{"id":"ea47eabc51d9439c","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-weak-pa.md","title":"Weak Peano Arithmetic","display":"df-weak-pa — Weak Peano Arithmetic","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-weak-pa","aliases":["92-df-weak-pa"],"display":"df-weak-pa — Weak Peano Arithmetic","depends_on":["[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[92-df-induction-schema]]","[[92-df-delta0-formula]]","[[92-df-sigma1-formula]]"],"source":"第 V 章 pp. 68–71（PDF 85–88）","source_status":"原书内容与本地呈现已分开"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-weak-pa"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-weak-pa</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-weak-pa — Weak Peano Arithmetic"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"468d35690d25ee42\" href=\"?note=468d35690d25ee42\" title=\"92-df-robinson-arithmetic\">92-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b0214c7ec3ea52ef\" href=\"?note=b0214c7ec3ea52ef\" title=\"92-df-induction-schema\">92-df-induction-schema</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d754a154b50a9533\" href=\"?note=d754a154b50a9533\" title=\"92-df-delta0-formula\">92-df-delta0-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8fd1dce21b2c65db\" href=\"?note=8fd1dce21b2c65db\" title=\"92-df-sigma1-formula\">92-df-sigma1-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 V 章 pp. 68–71（PDF 85–88）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容与本地呈现已分开"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> (Robinson arithmetic, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"468d35690d25ee42\" href=\"?note=468d35690d25ee42\" title=\"92-df-robinson-arithmetic\">92-df-robinson-arithmetic</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ind}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Ind}_G\\)</span> (restricted induction-schema constructor, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b0214c7ec3ea52ef\" href=\"?note=b0214c7ec3ea52ef\" title=\"92-df-induction-schema\">92-df-induction-schema</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0^G\">\\(\\Delta_0^G\\)</span> (bounded-formula class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d754a154b50a9533\" href=\"?note=d754a154b50a9533\" title=\"92-df-delta0-formula\">92-df-delta0-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1^G\">\\(\\Sigma_1^G\\)</span> (Sigma-1 formula class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8fd1dce21b2c65db\" href=\"?note=8fd1dce21b2c65db\" title=\"92-df-sigma1-formula\">92-df-sigma1-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\Delta_0,I\\Sigma_1,\\mathrm{WeakPA}_G\">\\(I\\Delta_0,I\\Sigma_1,\\mathrm{WeakPA}_G\\)</span> (definition targets)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}weak\\text{-}pa}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nI\\Delta_0&amp;\\coloneqq Q\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}_G(\\Delta_0^G),\\\\\nI\\Sigma_1&amp;\\coloneqq Q\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}_G(\\Sigma_1^G),\\\\\n\\mathrm{WeakPA}_G&amp;\\coloneqq\\{Q,I\\Delta_0,I\\Sigma_1\\}\n\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Fml}_G).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}weak\\text{-}pa}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nI\\Delta_0&amp;\\coloneqq Q\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}_G(\\Delta_0^G),\\\\\nI\\Sigma_1&amp;\\coloneqq Q\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}_G(\\Sigma_1^G),\\\\\n\\mathrm{WeakPA}_G&amp;\\coloneqq\\{Q,I\\Delta_0,I\\Sigma_1\\}\n\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Fml}_G).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>弱PA：限制归纳模式的PA片段</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span>：这里选用的七公理弱基理论之一，非原书九公理 (Q) 的字面集合</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\Delta_0\">\\(I\\Delta_0\\)</span>：仅<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0\">\\(\\Delta_0\\)</span>-归纳</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\Sigma_1\">\\(I\\Sigma_1\\)</span>：仅<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span>-归纳</li>\n<li>每个元素都是一个公理集，而不是一个形式系统三元组；需要可证关系时还须配上签名和规则</li>\n<li>Robinson <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span>本质不可判定，因此相容、有效可公理化并扩张<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span>的这些片段受不完备性约束；不能把“<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span>已够”理解成只要语言里出现<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span>的符号就够</li>\n<li>弱PA的证明力比PA弱</li>\n<li>有界算术基于弱PA的思想</li>\n<li>不完备性定理的前提可弱化至<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>原书重点讨论 (R₀)、(R)、(Q₀)、(Q) 的 Σ₀ 完备性。本地 Q、IΔ₀、IΣ₁ 是补充的标准片段分类，不能用它们替换书中弱系统的具体公理。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 V 章 pp. 68–73（PDF 85–90）。</p>\n<p>原书 Q₀/Q/R₀/R 的公理三元组现已见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"8ee662ea7161b3d7\" href=\"?note=8ee662ea7161b3d7\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-weak-systems\">92-df-smullyan-weak-systems</a>，Σ₀ 完备性与定理集包含分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"cf0f2611d5bc4db4\" href=\"?note=cf0f2611d5bc4db4\" title=\"92-thm-smullyan-weak-sigma0-completeness\">92-thm-smullyan-weak-sigma0-completeness</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"1af0375ea8173df2\" href=\"?note=1af0375ea8173df2\" title=\"92-thm-smullyan-weak-subsystems\">92-thm-smullyan-weak-subsystems</a>。本文 IΔ₀/IΣ₁ 分类继续作为本地补充，不将其归因为原书。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"li